Package: lab6
Title: Solve the Knapsack Problems with Brute Force, Dynamic Programming and 
  Greedy Algorithms
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements three algorithms for the 0/1 knapsack problem:
  an exact brute force search, an exact dynamic programming solution,
  and a fast greedy approximation. The brute force search can optionally be
  parallelized across multiple cores.
